{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>都市生活噪音不斷，想靜下心來專注工作或好好入睡，往往比想像中困難。《White Noise Sounds》收錄多種環境音效，包括雨聲、海浪、森林氛圍，以及白噪音、粉紅噪音與棕色噪音，適合需要放鬆、冥想、提升專注或改善睡眠的人使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多種環境音效隨心播放</h2>\n<p>應用內提供高品質音景，讓用家自行營造適合當下的聲音環境。想入睡時可播放柔和雨聲或海浪，幫助更快入眠；工作或讀書時可選擇白噪音，蓋過外界干擾，維持專注力；冥想練習時則可配搭森林氛圍，讓思緒沉澱。無論是減壓放鬆，還是為睡眠鋪路，都能從中獲得穩定而持續的聲音陪伴。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-168-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-169-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-171-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-172-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-173-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：White Noise Sounds – Nap Noise</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T01:04:50.893939+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}